{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_chat_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "2f460ad608c95d562a9549a85890f7efb4b7e18063b1f75b9f85d4068257d574", "ja": "{$P$}Pさん、\nまだお仕事中かなぁ。", "zh": "{$P$}P先生\n还在工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_chat_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "5ae77e0dad98492cd2fc09ad2b0ee88ce9878c67f6fa6d39d1bfe8d4151612df", "ja": "社長さんが、今日は面白い話が\nあるっておっしゃってたし、\n早く伝えなきゃ！", "zh": "社长说今天有很有趣的事情要找他，\n要赶快转告他才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_chat_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "ee2f4d8aec347433d1bc4b62074a2206e5ccf205e0684c6f5d38718de5b6dbfb", "ja": "でも、面白い話ってなんだろう？\nあっ。もしかして、劇場にカメさん\nのお池をつくるとか！", "zh": "不过，会是什么有趣的事呢？\n啊，该不会是剧场\n要挖一个池子养乌龟吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_chat_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "02f791e03a37910fe61ccd1d6519d7134f1993089281c04afc1cccc812b27adb", "ja": "…ううん、そんなのありえない。\nしっかりしなくちゃ。えいっ。", "zh": "……不对，这太离谱了。\n我要正经一点，加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
